  "measurement_note": "Split card is the full 1080x512 frame from y 1408 to 1920, flush to the bottom and to both side edges, top corners only at 31 px. The speaker is scaled so the face is about 215 px (200-230) and the crown clears y 1408 by about 70 px (50-100). Head, neck, and shoulders sit in the card. Empty sides are the source frame scaled to cover the card, blurred (sigma about 32) and darkened about 12%, with the matted speaker sharp on top. No tiling, no mirror, and no frame edge. Full and punch stay at scale 1. The graphic stage starts at y 270 and ends at y 1072. The phone mock is centered and at least 65% of the stage width. In split, one Inter Black line at about 54 px has its baseline 35 px above that segment's highest crown, near y 1305, and it does not track the head. caption_split_y is only the fallback before the matte measures the crown. Full-face captions are Inter Black at about 67 px. A timeline caption full_baseline_px sets that baseline per take so the letters clear the beard and the lav pin. A number count-up plays Ui 30 for the whole roll and a bell or ka-ching on the final number.",
